ecute edit path/to/file'` されてるんですけど、そのときにautocmdが期待通りに発火していない気がする、ですね","ts":"1622093026.354000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wab"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e853862a-ea20-4222-aaa5-81e53846d6b2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"状況説明やりたいところではあるんですが、根本的にfzf-previewの挙動が複雑すぎて厳しい","ts":"1622092953.352700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nanido","count":2,"users":["U03C71D7H","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zb="}]},{"client_msg_id":"af8550c8-152c-4b4e-b9dc-8f8f88bc6461","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、状況の説明が全然ないのでエスパーです","ts":"1622092920.352100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lDdl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bf00972-f55d-4d28-932c-2c75d7bd615b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"多分最終的にVitalのPromise内で走ってるとかはあるんですけど、挙動に影響する可能性ってありますか？","ts":"1622092913.351900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5rR5A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2f15bab-ad60-4d24-bb5a-186167c039f1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"nestedはautocmd -\u0026gt; 発火 -\u0026gt; exec なにか -\u0026gt; (他の)autocmd条件達成\nのときに、再度処理が動くようにする、だったはず","ts":"1622092883.351300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/h5I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d5c9382-84ca-49b8-9ffe-cdb913464625","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"RPC使ってるとかで非同期で動きつつ訳分からん流れで最後にコマンドが実行されてるとかが悪さしていそう","ts":"1622092856.350600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Egl/B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10166b8c-3643-42f3-b4a5-b1dcee2a126d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"関係あるのかなぁこれ、なさそうな気がしてるけど","ts":"1622092817.349600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gbEDk"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *autocmd-nested* *E218*\n既定では、自動コマンドはネストしない (入れ子にならない)。例えば、自動コマンド\n内で \":e\" や \":w\" を使っても、これらに対してはイベント BufRead や BufWrite に\nよる自動コマンドは実行されない。もしこれを実行してほしいなら、ネストしてほしい\nコマンド内でフラグ \"nested\" を使うこと。例:  \n  :autocmd FileChangedShell *.c ++nested e!\n再帰的ループを避けるために、ネストは10段階までに制限されている。\n \n自動コマンドの中でコマンド \":au\" を使うこともできる。これは自己修正的 {訳注:\n原文 \"self-modifying\"} なコマンドになりうる! これは1回だけ実行すべき自動コマン\nドに便利である。\n \nあるコマンドを実行するときだけ自動コマンドをスキップしたい場合は、修飾子\n|:noautocmd| を使うかオプション 'eventignore' を使う。\n \nNote (\":read file\" やフィルタコマンドで) 読み込んだファイルの最後の行に \u0026lt;EOL\u0026gt;\nがないとき、Vimはこのことを記憶する。その次の (\":write file\" やフィルタコマン\nドでの) 書き込みで、先ほどの最後の行が再び最後の行として書き込まれ、かつオプ\nション 'binary' がオンになっていると、\u0026lt;EOL\u0026gt; は付け足されない。これにより、読み\n込まれた行に対するフィルタコマンドで、読み込まれた通りに書き出すことができる。\nまた、フィルタ処理された行に対する書き込みのコマンドで、フィルタが出力した通り\nに書き出すことができる。例えば、圧縮されたファイルを書き込むもう一つの例は以下\nのようになる。  \n \n  :autocmd FileWritePre *.gz   set bin|'[,']!gzip\n  :autocmd FileWritePost *.gz  undo|set nobin\n```","ts":"1622092783.349200","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"96253825-a51c-41d5-b735-66cae153317e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h autocmd-nested","ts":"1622092783.349100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f47f66f9-6bbd-40ab-bf49-89f71f42550f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どうやって引くんだこれ・・・","ts":"1622092766.348900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qkPPn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98c5b58b-ebb6-4aea-bb9b-f31e013cd92d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"nested使ったことなかった","ts":"1622092749.348700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gytJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc7ed824-7a3e-42ab-a515-5b67acf9fd1d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ありがちなのは ++nested 忘れてて着火しないとか","ts":"1622092731.348500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lih/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41533de8-d6e5-4c9e-b34b-654d8a15aadb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"なんかこの辺とか含め訳分からんことになっててヤバそう","ts":"1622092696.348100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t=Bw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa7af589-ca9b-4fd8-9719-42be87a569ef","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`BufEnter` はウィンドウ間移動しただけでも発生する","ts":"1622092686.347900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9yK6P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a725430c-c74f-456c-b3e8-8fe4ed5114ca","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"確認したら内部で最終的に実行されるコマンドが\n`execute 'execute edit path/to/file'` とかになってたんですよね","ts":"1622092684.347700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nm27C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83a89e4c-2389-4cd7-9240-3e687e162b1b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`autocmd BufEnter *.py echomsg \u0026amp;ft` で vim foo.py で `python` が echo されたからはいってる？","ts":"1622092664.347000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0Z6T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2b0fd3d-9c58-4c3b-b7d9-7a50d2e4641c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私がdefxで避けた理由の一つ","ts":"1622092606.346100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XuK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db873d3b-e1ff-41ef-b839-0939914d5599","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"autocmdの問題は結構難しい","ts":"1622092589.346000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t